<h1 local-id=3D"a1707c7e2a3d" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984047ExecutiveSummary"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984047"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984047"></span></span>Executive Summary</h1>
<p>The Task Management and SLA Workflow module provides structured task han=
dling within the system to ensure operational visibility, accountability, a=
nd timely resolution of tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b2a72d17c65">The module enables users to perform task-relat=
ed actions through a controlled workflow supported by mandatory comments, s=
tatus tracking, SLA monitoring, escalation mechanisms, reassignment capabil=
ities, and prioritization management. Each task follows a defined lifecycle=
 starting from task creation and assignment, progressing through status cha=
nges, and concluding when the task is completed or cancelled.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d551e856651a">To maintain transparency and accountability, e=
very action taken on a task requires a mandatory comment and is recorded wi=
thin the task history log. The system enforces comment validation rules, pr=
events actions without proper documentation, and maintains a complete audit=
 trail of all changes.</p>
<p local-id=3D"829b42ad151e">The module also incorporates Service Level Agr=
eement (SLA) monitoring based on task priority levels. SLA timers begin whe=
n the task is created and are calculated within defined business hours. The=
 system monitors SLA progress, generates notifications when tasks approach =
their SLA threshold, and marks tasks as overdue when the SLA expires. Notif=
ications and visual indicators ensure that administrators, managers, and as=
signed users are aware of tasks that require attention.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6d2eeed419bc">Critical tasks receive immediate notification =
upon creation due to their high priority and shorter SLA duration. The syst=
em also supports escalation and reassignment workflows to ensure that tasks=
 can be redirected when required.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1fbb0949999e">Additionally, administrative configuration opt=
ions allow SLA durations to be defined and managed through the business con=
figuration settings. All SLA configuration changes are recorded for audit p=
urposes.</p>
<p local-id=3D"19e892fa70da">This functionality ensures improved operationa=
l control, visibility across teams, and adherence to defined service timeli=
nes.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"c035144c0efe" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984048BusinessObjectives"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Bu=
sinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984048"><span class=3D"confluence-an=
chor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984048"></span></span>Business Objectives</h1>
<p>The objectives of implementing the Task Management and SLA Workflow modu=
le are:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Ensure that every task action performed within the system is documented =
through mandatory comments for operational visibility and accountability.</=
p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide a structured workflow that enables users to update task status t=
hrough predefined actions including reassignment, escalation, reprioritisat=
ion, and completion.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enable administrators and managers to track task progress through clearl=
y defined statuses and historical activity logs.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Introduce SLA monitoring to ensure tasks are addressed within defined ti=
meframes based on priority levels.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notify relevant users when tasks approach SLA thresholds to prevent over=
due tasks.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Highlight overdue tasks visually within the system to improve response t=
ime and operational awareness.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enable escalation and reassignment capabilities to ensure tasks can be r=
edirected to the appropriate users when necessary.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Maintain a complete audit trail of all task actions including user activ=
ity, timestamps, and comments.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Allow SLA configurations to be managed by administrators through configu=
rable business settings.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Ensure critical tasks receive immediate attention through system-generat=
ed notifications.</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"6e22cad64531" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984049Background"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"BusinessRe=
quirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984049"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-lin=
k" id=3D"_Toc223984049"></span></span>Background</h1>
<p>During operational workflows, tasks are created and assigned to users wi=
thin the organization. These tasks require a structured approach for monito=
ring progress, ensuring timely resolution, and maintaining visibility acros=
s administrative and managerial roles.</p>
<p>The absence of consistent documentation and standardized task handling p=
rocesses can lead to delays, lack of accountability, and reduced operationa=
l transparency. To address these challenges, the Task Management and SLA Wo=
rkflow module introduces structured processes that govern how tasks are han=
dled within the system.</p>
<p>The system ensures that every action taken on a task is recorded with a =
mandatory comment. This requirement ensures that stakeholders have visibili=
ty into the actions performed and the reasoning behind them. A comment remi=
nder banner is displayed within the interface to reinforce this requirement=
.</p>
<p>The module introduces predefined task statuses that guide the lifecycle =
of a task. Users interact with tasks through a status action dropdown that =
allows them to update the task status while recording supporting comments.<=
/p>
<p>In addition to status tracking, the module introduces SLA monitoring bas=
ed on task priority. Each task is assigned a priority level that determines=
 the allowed timeframe for completion. The SLA timer begins when the task i=
s created and continues running regardless of status changes such as reassi=
gnment or escalation.</p>
<p>To ensure that tasks receive attention before becoming overdue, the syst=
em monitors SLA thresholds and notifies relevant users when a task approach=
es its deadline. If the SLA expires without completion, the system marks th=
e task as overdue and visually highlights it within the user interface.</p>
<p>Critical priority tasks require faster response times and therefore trig=
ger immediate notifications upon creation.</p>
<p>The system also supports escalation and reassignment workflows, enabling=
 tasks to be transferred to other users when required. All such actions are=
 recorded in the task history log, ensuring complete traceability.</p>
<p>Through these mechanisms, the Task Management and SLA Workflow module en=
sures consistent task handling, improved visibility, and adherence to opera=
tional timelines.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"18e8ac4ae912" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984050Scope"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"BusinessRequire=
mentDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984050"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=
=3D"_Toc223984050"></span></span>Scope</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"bad2b54f1a13" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984051InScope"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"BusinessRequi=
rementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984051"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" =
id=3D"_Toc223984051"></span></span>In Scope</h2>
<p>The following functionalities are included within the Task Management an=
d SLA Workflow module:</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"73368e869be3" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984052TaskStatusManagement"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"=
BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984052"><span class=3D"confluence-=
anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984052"></span></span>Task Status Management</h2>
<p>The system shall provide a dropdown menu that allows users to perform ta=
sk status actions. The available options include:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Action Completed</p></li>
<li>
<p>In Progress</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reassigned</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reprioritised</p></li>
<li>
<p>Cancelled (Action no longer required)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Escalation</p></li>
</ul>
<p>The selected option will update the stored status of the task.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"25af08d296c1" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984053TaskStatusLifecycle"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"B=
usinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984053"><span class=3D"confluence-a=
nchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984053"></span></span>Task Status Lifecycle</h2>
<p>The system shall support the following task statuses:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assigned</p></li>
<li>
<p>In Progress</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reassigned</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reprioritised</p></li>
<li>
<p>Escalated</p></li>
<li>
<p>Cancelled</p></li>
<li>
<p>Completed</p></li>
<li>
<p>Overdue</p></li>
</ul>
<p>When a task is created, its default status shall be <strong>Assigned</st=
rong>.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"a5cdfb695802" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984054MandatoryCommentRequirement"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link"=
 id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984054"><span class=3D"conf=
luence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984054"></span></span>Mandatory Comment Re=
quirement</h2>
<p>Before performing any task action, users must enter a comment explaining=
 the action taken.</p>
<p>The system shall not allow any action to be performed without entering a=
 valid comment.</p>
<p>The action button shall remain disabled until a valid comment is entered=
.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"19e9d24dab1a" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984055CommentReminder"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busin=
essRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984055"><span class=3D"confluence-ancho=
r-link" id=3D"_Toc223984055"></span></span>Comment Reminder</h2>
<p>The system shall display a reminder banner above the comment box.</p>
<p>The banner will remind users that comments are required for every action=
 taken for visibility.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"89152a02828e" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984056TaskReassignment"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984056"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984056"></span></span>Task Reassignment</h2>
<p>When the <strong>Reassigned</strong> action is selected:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The user shall be able to choose another user.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The selected user must belong to the same Business Area as the task.</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>The Business Area shall be derived from the user profile.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>Ownership of the task shall transfer to the newly selected user.</p>
<p>The SLA timer shall continue running and shall not reset.</p>
<p>The previous owner shall only be able to view the task within the task h=
istory and not within their active task list.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"4ca7665aabea" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984057TaskEscalation"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busine=
ssRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984057"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor=
-link" id=3D"_Toc223984057"></span></span>Task Escalation</h2>
<p>When the <strong>Escalation</strong> action is selected:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The user shall be able to choose any user.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Ownership of the task shall transfer to the selected user.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>The SLA timer shall continue running and shall not reset.</p>
<p>The escalation action shall be recorded within the task history log.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e859500e8a82"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3333e74b011e" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984058TaskReprioritisation"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"=
BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984058"><span class=3D"confluence-=
anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984058"></span></span>Task Reprioritisation</h2>
<p>When the <strong>Reprioritise</strong> action is selected:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The user shall be able to change the task priority.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The priority can be changed to any available level.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>When the priority changes:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2fcd83a1a8c9">
<li>
<p>The SLA shall be recalculated.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"15c53a4cb4ac">
<p local-id=3D"3283d35c13e7">The SLA timer shall reset based on the new pri=
ority.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"d2c74b77015a" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984059TaskCompletion"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busine=
ssRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984059"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor=
-link" id=3D"_Toc223984059"></span></span>Task Completion</h2>
<p>When <strong>Action Completed</strong> is selected:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c31143928464">
<li local-id=3D"2f909b64895e">
<p local-id=3D"bddb6cb442ec">The task shall move to the Completed tab.</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"f14daeb5c1a7" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984060TaskCancellation"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984060"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984060"></span></span>Task Cancellation</h2>
<p>When <strong>Cancelled (Action no longer required)</strong> is selected:=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2a41d3ac8c23">
<li>
<p>The task shall move to the Completed tab.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6269741cab64">
<p local-id=3D"5eecf74995cf">The task status shall remain <strong>Cancelled=
</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"6c5a33285f12" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984061TaskEditingRestrictions"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=
=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984061"><span class=3D"conflue=
nce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984061"></span></span>Task Editing Restrictio=
ns</h2>
<p>After a task is created:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>No task data fields shall be editable.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>Any changes to a task must occur through status actions such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Reassignment</p></li>
<li>
<p>Escalation</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reprioritisation</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status updates</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"adf5d7525d9c">Each action must include a new comment and mus=
t be stored within the task history.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"e4940776465f" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984062Stakeholders"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Business=
RequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984062"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-l=
ink" id=3D"_Toc223984062"></span></span>Stakeholders</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Name</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Role</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Responsibility</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>System Administrator</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Manages system configuration, SLA settings, and oversees all tasks acros=
s business areas</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Manager</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Business Area Manager</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Monitors tasks within their business area and ensures SLA compliance</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Assigned User</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Task Owner</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Responsible for performing actions on assigned tasks and completing them=
 within SLA</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
