<h1 local-id=3D"89c90fbe5bfd" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984074SLAConfiguration"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984074"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984074"></span></span>SLA Configuration</h1>
<p>The system shall support SLA monitoring based on task priority.</p>
<p>SLA configuration shall be managed by administrators through <strong>Bus=
iness Configuration Settings</strong> in the frontend.</p>
<p>All changes made to SLA configuration shall be recorded within an <stron=
g>audit trail</strong>.</p>
<p>SLA shall be calculated based on <strong>business hours only</strong>.</=
p>
<p>Business hours shall be defined as:</p>
<p><strong>08:00 AM =E2=80=93 04:00 PM</strong></p>
<p>The SLA timer shall begin when the task is created.</p>
<p></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"2633393a4790" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984075SLAPriorityLevels"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Bus=
inessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984075"><span class=3D"confluence-anc=
hor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984075"></span></span>SLA Priority Levels</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>SLA Duration</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Critical</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>30 minutes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>High</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>60 minutes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Medium</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>4 hours</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Low</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>8 hours</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>The above are customizable through the frontend of the webapp.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bd86895cd3c6" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984076SLABehaviour"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Business=
RequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984076"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-l=
ink" id=3D"_Toc223984076"></span></span>SLA Behaviour</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>SLA begins when the task is created.</p></li>
<li>
<p>SLA continues running when a task is <strong>In Progress</strong>.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>SLA continues running when a task is <strong>Reassigned</strong>.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>SLA continues running when a task is <strong>Escalated</strong>.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>SLA is recalculated and reset when a task is <strong>Reprioritised</stro=
ng>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"16557d741a00" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984077SLAAddressedCondition"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D=
"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984077"><span class=3D"confluence=
-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984077"></span></span>SLA Addressed Condition</h=
2>
<p>A task shall be considered <strong>addressed</strong> when the status is=
 changed to <strong>In Progress</strong>.</p>
<p></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"1af29bace277" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984078SLAAlertsandPopups"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Bu=
sinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984078"><span class=3D"confluence-an=
chor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984078"></span></span>SLA Alerts and Popups</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"6aee8d11c004" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984079ApproachingSLAAlert"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"B=
usinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984079"><span class=3D"confluence-a=
nchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984079"></span></span>Approaching SLA Alert</h2>
<p>The system shall monitor tasks approaching their SLA limit.</p>
<p>The threshold for approaching SLA shall be defined as:</p>
<p><strong>25% of remaining SLA time.</strong></p>
<p>When this threshold is reached:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>A popup notification shall be displayed.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The popup shall appear <strong>only once</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>The popup shall be visible to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assigned user</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manager of the business area</p></li>
<li>
<p>Admin</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"da1f4bb9b525" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984080SLAExpiryBehaviour"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Bu=
sinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984080"><span class=3D"confluence-an=
chor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984080"></span></span>SLA Expiry Behaviour</h2>
<p>When the SLA expires:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The task shall be marked as <strong>Overdue</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The task shall be visually highlighted in <strong>red</strong> within th=
e user interface.</p></li>
<li>
<p>A popup notification shall be displayed.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>The popup shall be visible to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assigned user</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manager of the business area</p></li>
<li>
<p>Admin</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"4f26bbee7cba" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984081CriticalTaskPopup"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Bus=
inessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984081"><span class=3D"confluence-anc=
hor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984081"></span></span>Critical Task Popup</h2>
<p>Critical priority tasks require immediate attention.</p>
<p>When a task with <strong>Critical priority</strong> is created:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>A popup notification shall be displayed <strong>immediately</strong>.</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p>The popup shall be visible to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assigned user</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manager of the business area</p></li>
<li>
<p>Admin</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"df99c5f1b90b" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984082TaskVisibility"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busine=
ssRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984082"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor=
-link" id=3D"_Toc223984082"></span></span>Task Visibility</h1>
<p>Task visibility shall be controlled based on user roles.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Role</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Task Visibility</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Admin</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Can view all tasks across the business area</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Manager</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Can view tasks within their business area</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Other Users</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Can view only tasks assigned to them</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Business Area information shall be retrieved from the <strong>User Profi=
le</strong>.</p>
<p></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"786884cb78f9" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984083TaskIDGeneration"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984083"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984083"></span></span>Task ID Generation</h1>
<p>The system shall generate a unique task ID for every task created.</p>
<p>The task ID shall follow a sequential system-generated format:</p>
<p><strong>TASK-00001</strong></p>
<p>Each newly created task shall increment the sequence automatically.</p>
<p></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"a536d4795346" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984084DashboardMetrics"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Busi=
nessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984084"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"_Toc223984084"></span></span>Dashboard Metrics</h1>
<p>The system shall display task metrics within dashboards.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Metric</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Definition</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Inside SLA</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tasks that still have remaining SLA time</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Approaching SLA</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tasks that have reached the 25% SLA threshold</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Overdue</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tasks where the SLA has expired</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"6d5e268b2401" id=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc2=
23984085TaskHistoryandAuditTrail"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=
=3D"BusinessRequirementDocument-Tasks-_Toc223984085"><span class=3D"conflue=
nce-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc223984085"></span></span>Task History and Audit =
Trail</h1>
<p>The system shall maintain a complete audit trail of task activity.</p>
<p>Each task history entry shall capture the following information:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Timestamp of the action</p></li>
<li>
<p>User who performed the action</p></li>
<li>
<p>Action performed</p></li>
<li>
<p>Comment entered by the user</p></li>
</ul>
<p>Example history structure content:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Timestamp</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>User</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Action</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Comment</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>10:30</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User A</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Reassigned</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Please review this task</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>10:45</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User B</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>In Progress</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#auto" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Working on the task</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Task history shall preserve all previous comments and actions.</p>
<p>Previous owners of reassigned or escalated tasks shall retain access to =
the task <strong>only through task history</strong>.</p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
